NPU-side gate for plans that are not streamed (one replay group, e.g. the NPU GEMM with final outputs): the control
program is [call | gate | done] and the product publishes four invocations (array setup + call, call, gate, done), so
a host runs a job of calls as [gate][call]...[call][done] with one gate per job, as streamed plans do with [gate | done]
(patch 0016). Ungated plans and streamed plans are unchanged.

